<div class="bar"><span class="ctr">1 / 18</span><button class="fs">Full screen</button></div>
<div class="thumbs"></div></section><section role="tabpanel" id="p1" aria-labelledby="t1" hidden data-n="18">
<div class="head"><div><h2>Quantum Search: Applications &amp; Variants</h2><p>Applications of Grover search, worked examples and algorithm variants.</p></div>
<a class="dl" download="Quantum_Search_Applications_Variants.pptx" href="data:application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation;base64,">Download PPTX</a></div>
<div class="stage"><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous slide">‹</button><img alt="Slide 1" data-src='data:image/jpeg;base64,|data:image/jpeg;base64,|data:image/jpeg;base64,|data:image/jpeg;base64,|data:image/jpeg;base64,|data:image/jpeg;base64,|data:image/jpeg;base64,|data:image/jpeg;base64,|data:image/jpeg;base64,|data:image/jpeg;base64,|data:image/jpeg;base64,|data:image/jpeg;base64,|data:image/jpeg;base64,|data:image/jpeg;base64,|data:image/jpeg;base64,|data:image/jpeg;base64,|data:image/jpeg;base64,|data:image/jpeg;base64,'><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next slide">›</button></div>
<div class="bar"><span class="ctr">1 / 18</span><button class="fs">Full screen</button></div>
